# Responsive

Mobile-first. Verify at base, `sm`, `md`, `lg`, `xl`, `2xl`.

- base (&lt;640): single column, drawer nav
- sm 640+: larger phone
- md 768+: tablet grids; drawer until lg
- lg 1024+: persistent sidebar
- xl 1280+: denser tables / max-width
- 2xl 1536+: avoid ultra-stretch

Shell: drawer below `lg`. No horizontal page scroll. Logical props for RTL (`ps`/`pe`/`ms`/`me`).

Tables: internal scroll or card list on small screens. Touch targets ~44px. Recharts `ResponsiveContainer`.

Forbidden: desktop-first only, fixed `w-[1440px]` shells, hover-only critical actions, clipped tables.
